# add a "skill" to the robots skillset the control system will send a string with the ls_item and action and here we will look if we have a matching skill to execute
# the item_modell defines the patterns which have to be used by the robot on multiple racks and or multiple samples in a rackpattern
# inner pattern is always dependung on the object that has to be moved and the outer pattern is the pattern for the containers where the objects are stored in.
# if racks have to be handled it is also an inner pattern cause the object to handle is the rack itself 
